# SafetyXAcademy Company DNA

Before any brand-facing work (brand naming, visual identity, design, copy, email, SEO, UI, or marketing assets), read and follow the repository root file:

`COMPANY-DNA.md`

That file is the permanent source of truth. Do not invent brand spellings or redesign the identity without explicit owner instruction.

## Quick locks

| Rule | Value |
|------|--------|
| Written brand name | `SafetyXAcademy` |
| Visual wordmark | `safetyXacademy` (`X` in Safety Orange) |
| Safety Orange | `#FF6600` (use existing design token if present) |
| SEO title suffix | `\| SafetyXAcademy` |
| Email sender | `SafetyXAcademy <info@safetyxacademy.nl>` |
| Domain | `safetyxacademy.nl` |

## Agent behaviour

1. Preserve `SafetyXAcademy` in prose, SEO, schema, email, legal, and forms.
2. Preserve `safetyXacademy` where a styled logo treatment is appropriate; only the X is orange.
3. Never use variants such as `Safety X Academy`, `SafetyXacademy`, or `safetyxacademy` as the written brand name.
4. Do not globally replace brand names or redesign working components unless explicitly asked.
5. If existing code or copy conflicts with `COMPANY-DNA.md`, flag the inconsistency — do not silently “fix” the brand to match old pages.
6. Only update `COMPANY-DNA.md` when the owner explicitly instructs a DNA change.
